WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.300
He didn't know what to get him — money for my child.

00:06.400 --> 00:08.400
We did as you asked.

00:09.180 --> 00:10.450
Now pay us.

00:12.300 --> 00:15.100
He's so polite. Yes, sir. Yes, sir. No, sir.

00:15.100 --> 00:20.000
…five million dollars for a snuff film.

00:20.600 --> 00:22.350
Not too much to pay.

00:23.450 --> 00:29.350
And you make sure your body cam is on — and tell us what number you're on.

00:31.200 --> 00:36.700
I failed him. We took money for his life.

00:37.500 --> 00:39.000
Intolerable.
